From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Network and storage the way iOS 6 can

A ws:// WebSocket opens without asking CFNetwork about HSTS, which this release
cannot answer; a private session's cookies stay out of the shared jar; Brotli
streams say they are unavailable instead of pretending to work; SQLite is not
initialized from the main thread; a resource that closing a tab already took
away is not dereferenced; and the icon a page declares is loaded by the engine.
---
